WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:06.125
Is this the Keepers' Union?!

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.541
I noticed something in the sky...

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:10.291
a giant meteor heading straight for Earth!

00:00:10.291 --> 00:00:14.083
I'm asking you, goalkeepers, to save the Earth!

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.333
I have an idea.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.541
Gentlemen, meet ze gigantsky mega vratar.

00:00:18.541 --> 00:00:20.708
Also known as Goaltron.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:21.375
It’s coming left!

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.500
No, you vollpfosten! It’s right. We need to dive right!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Nein! Manuel, nein!

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Stay back! Stay back!

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:28.625
Oh...scheisse!

00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.833
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers...

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:35.708
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.458
Players stop being polite...

00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:39.541
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:40.416
This is...

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.791
The Champions.

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.708
Dele...everything is in shambles!

00:00:53.708 --> 00:00:54.750
Yeah, yeah I get it.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.875
We’ve just got to take it one match at a time, I suppose.

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:58.291
No, Dele, look!

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:01.291
Oh…I guess this is a little worse than normal.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.125
Ugh...nein.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:17.125
Ugh...this was supposed to be our year!

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:18.833
And now the world is ending!

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:21.791
Ha, yes! All my prayers have been answered!

00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:22.541
Kevin?

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:25.125
Don’t you see? Everything is destroyed!

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:28.958
Man City will be the last team to ever win the Premier League title.

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:30.708
Mmm...Kevin...

00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:35.375
Can I get a little help here? I can’t do this by myself.

00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:41.583
Aw man, I just got my braces off.

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.708
In chaos...everything is legal.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.291
Oh, no.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.791
Not today, Sergio!

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:57.208
Is this the knockout stage? It’s crazier than I thought.

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:03.083
Oh, oh thank goodness. There you are. 

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:05.083
My precious little Yankee boy.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.583
I thought to be accepted at Chelsea,

00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.333
I’d have to do all these British things.

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:11.541
It turns out, all I had to do was score a bunch of goals.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.000
Come on, get in, we'll get you to safety!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Where would you take us?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.875
Back to Europa house. It’s still standing.

00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:21.958
Eh...I’d rather take my chances.

00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:25.041
All right, suit yourselves. Ole’s at the wheel!

00:02:25.041 --> 00:02:27.000
Ole's at the wheel!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.125
I don't park the bus–I gun it!

00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:35.666
I don’t see what everyone is complaining about.

00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:37.083
Yeah, feels like a home game.

00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:38.416
Please let me in, please let me in!

00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:40.666
Oh, my botox is melting!

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:44.958
Is the air worse in here?

00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:47.583
I haven’t seen a disaster this bad

00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:49.791
since I played for FC Pompeii.

00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:52.208
That’s nothing. I used to play for Arsenal.

00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:52.916
Yikes.

00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:56.125
What was that?

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:57.125
Oh, my stomach.

00:02:57.125 --> 00:03:00.166
I'm 12 minutes overdue for my fourth protein meal.

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:00.708
It's OK.

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:03.500
We have a year supply of non-perishable foods in here.

00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:09.333
No...Benzema.

00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:12.916
Looks like all the food is gone...you know what this means:

00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:14.958
It's OK to eat people!

00:03:34.583 --> 00:03:38.291
So, uh…should we...head back?

00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:39.833
We can’t go back. We blew it.

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:42.458
We’ll be a bunch of, Loris Kariuses down there.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.958
Hey, look!

00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:50.791
Attention. Keepers of the Champions League...and De Gea.

00:03:50.791 --> 00:03:53.125
After review by Galactic VAR,

00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:56.083
We have determined that during the buildup of the meteor,

00:03:56.083 --> 00:03:58.000
a dust particle was offside.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.208
The meteor strike is disallowed.

00:04:00.416 --> 00:04:01.500
What?!

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:10.708
Everything is back to normal!

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:14.291
Yes! Haha! We're back at the top of the table.

00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:16.416
Agh. Stupid galactic VAR.

00:04:16.416 --> 00:04:19.583
I guess we’re gonna have to do it the old-fashioned way.

00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:21.958
Winning 18 matches in a row.

00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:23.583
Uh, must be nice.

00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:26.833
Harry, it's OK. I'm here now.

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:29.375
And remember, it could always be worse.

00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:33.666
We have three whole years before that happens.

00:04:33.666 --> 00:04:35.250
And by then you'll be long gone.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.250
Hey, look.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.541
The Champions League mansion went back to normal. 

00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:40.708
When do we get to reset back to normal?

00:04:40.708 --> 00:04:43.625
Unfortunately, Phil, I think this is the new normal.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:10.000
This cartoon?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.666
It is the "special one" of cartoons.

00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:13.708
So park your bus right here,

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:16.416
and show your respect by subscribing.

